The Daszyński network keeps its gathering small, masked and separate from the
announced motorcade. Trade unionists and local historians complete the ceremony
without asking either the government or the nationalist organisers to suspend
the rules for them.

- @ind20_riot: Follow the march into the evening

@ind20_join
title: Join the advertised motorcade with a social-patriotic Left column
subtitle: Claim the national stage from within; accept responsibility for the company kept there.
on-arrival: independence_march_strategy = "Join the Independence March"; independence_join_years += 1; civic_patriotism += 5; social_patriot_support += 9; left_cultural_position += 4; left_right_score += 4; rural_support += 2; progressives_dissent += 7; spring_dissent += 5; razem_dissent += 5; progressive_credibility -= 4; public_trust -= 2; minority_safety -= 2; far_right_street_capacity += 2; far_right_fragmentation += 1; public_mood_pending_national_security_support += 5; public_mood_pending_refugee_solidarity_support -= 4; public_mood_pending_refugee_solidarity_backlash += 5; news_headline = "A social-patriotic Left column joins the Independence March motorcade"

Our social patriots place workers' demands and Left MPs inside the advertised
motorcade. When people leave their vehicles and the procession thickens, our
column is no longer commenting on the organisers' decisions from a distance.

- @ind20_riot: Follow the march into the evening

@ind20_consistent
title: Defend one assembly standard for nationalists and the Women's Strike
subtitle: Publish one legal test for both demonstrations and accept anger from both camps.
on-arrival: independence_march_strategy = "Legal consistency"; constitutional_restraint += 5; feminist_trust += 2; public_trust += 2; far_right_agenda += 1; barons_dissent += 2; news_headline = "The Left applies one pandemic and protest standard"

Lewica lawyers publish the same demands for necessity, proportional policing
and access to counsel for the Women's Strike and the nationalist march. Women's
Strike organisers accept the protection but resent the comparison; the march
leadership cites only the passages that limit police power.

- @ind20_riot: Follow the march into the evening

@ind20_monitor
title: Expand the legal-observer and safety network
on-arrival: independence_march_strategy = "Legal monitoring"; independence_monitor_years += 1; police_trust += 2; minority_safety += 4; movement_autonomy += 2; media_capacity += 2; public_mood_pending_refugee_solidarity_support += 8; public_mood_pending_national_security_salience += 3; news_headline = "One safety network watches both protest policing and nationalist violence"

Observers trained during last year's march deploy beside journalists, legal
teams and residents along the route. They record the crowd and the police line
under one evidentiary standard, knowing that both sides will later demand only
the footage that vindicates them.

- @ind20_riot: Follow the march into the evening

@ind20_ignore
title: Keep every organiser focused on the abortion revolt
on-arrival: independence_march_strategy = "Ignore the march"; independence_ignored_years += 1; feminist_trust += 3; far_right_street_capacity += 4; far_right_agenda += 3; civic_patriotism -= 1; public_mood_pending_refugee_solidarity_support -= 2; public_mood_pending_national_security_salience += 2; news_headline = "The Left leaves Independence Day to the radical right"

Every available organiser remains with the Women's Strike, where the immediate
attack on abortion rights plainly deserves them. The choice strengthens that
movement and leaves nobody carrying a Lewica account of what happens inside
the other procession.

- @ind20_riot: Follow the march into the evening

@ind20_riot
title: The motorcade becomes a riot
on-arrival: independence_2020_riot_done = 1

= Stones, flares and an apartment fire

The announced pandemic motorcade spills into a procession on foot. Near Rondo
de Gaulle'a and the approaches to Stadion Narodowy, police meet stones and
flares with gas, stun grenades and smooth-bore launchers. A flare ignites an
apartment by Poniatowski Bridge; injured officers, detainees and the burned
home leave several records to investigate, not one convenient story.

[? if independence_march_strategy = "Join the Independence March": Our own
column was inside the march. The claim that participation could reclaim the
national stage now carries witnesses, photographs and direct responsibility.?]
[? if independence_march_strategy = "Legal monitoring": The observer network
has footage from both the crowd and the police line. Its credibility depends
on publishing the whole sequence.?]
[? if independence_march_strategy = "Civic tradition": Our lawful ceremony
ended before the violence. The separation protects its credibility, but the
larger march still determines what most viewers associate with Independence
Day.?]
[? if independence_march_strategy = "Legal consistency": The common legal
standard now meets its hardest case. We must distinguish protected assembly
from arson and assault without granting the police an unlimited account of its
own force.?]
[? if independence_march_strategy = "Ignore the march": Women's Strike
organisers kept our full attention, but the evening's national story now
belongs to the government, the police and the march organisers. We have no
independent record to place between them.?]

- @ind20_riot_break
- @ind20_riot_inquiry
- @ind20_riot_defend

@ind20_riot_break
title: Denounce the march organisers and support the burned-out resident
subtitle: Preserve a patriotic Left while naming whom the march empowered.
on-arrival: independence_2020_riot_response = "Break with organisers and support victims"; civic_patriotism += 2; public_trust += 3; minority_safety += 4; social_patriot_support -= 3; far_right_fragmentation += 2; news_headline = "Lewica names the riot, opens its footage and funds victim support"

Our speakers name the arson and assaults without euphemism, release whatever
evidence the party holds and help the resident whose apartment burned. Social
patriots lose the claim that the march could be civilised from within; the
civic-independence current survives by drawing a boundary in public.

- @poland_event_queue: Carry the break back to the leadership table

@ind20_riot_inquiry
title: Demand one independent inquiry into arson, fascist symbols and police force
subtitle: The legal record will protect neither rioters nor officers from scrutiny.
on-arrival: independence_2020_riot_response = "Independent inquiry into riot and policing"; independence_monitor_years += 1; constitutional_restraint += 4; minority_safety += 2; media_capacity += 2; public_trust += 2; news_headline = "Lewica demands one evidentiary record of the riot and police response"

Lawyers place the apartment fire, fascist symbols, attacks on officers,
detentions and every documented use of police weapons in one demand for an
independent inquiry. Neither the march leadership nor the Interior Ministry
gets to edit the sequence down to its preferred victimhood.

- @poland_event_queue: Carry the inquiry back to the leadership table

@ind20_riot_defend
title: Defend the march organisers and blame the escalation on police provocation
subtitle: The organisers will welcome our defence; progressives and threatened minorities will remember whom we chose to believe.
on-arrival: independence_2020_riot_response = "Defend march against police provocation"; social_patriot_support += 6; left_cultural_position += 3; left_right_score += 3; progressives_dissent += 7; spring_dissent += 5; razem_dissent += 5; police_trust -= 5; minority_safety -= 4; far_right_street_capacity += 4; far_right_agenda += 3; anti_ukrainian_pressure += 1; public_mood_pending_refugee_solidarity_support += -4; public_mood_pending_rule_of_law_support += -5; news_headline = "Lewica's social patriots defend the march and inherit its enemies"

Our speakers describe the police charge as the cause of the night's violence
and defend the organisers. The march welcomes the parliamentary cover.
Progressive members, minority organisations and the burned-out resident hear
something else: Lewica has chosen the procession over them.

- @poland_event_queue: Carry the defence back to the leadership table

